    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUT NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/8988c330ce27ca9afb54d238144d8c69.avif?t=1750311983\" width=800 height=369 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf89 BREAKING NEWS: This Game is Ground Breaking\u2026 literally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After months of <i>digging deep</i> and <i>breaking everything in sight</i>, we\u2019ve finally done it \u2014 <i>This Game is Ground Breaking</i> is now available for FREE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve sacrificed no sleep but a lot of brain cells to bring you a game that:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Will make you want to bash your friend with a controller<br>\ud83d\udc94 Never let your sibling forget who is better and therefore more loved <br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Makes you realise that you were never good at video games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it now, so you can get over your depression in preparation for GTA VI\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is ground breaking</strong>-ly fun! The most popular game at our local gamescom is now on Steam! <strong>This Game is Ground breaking</strong> is a <strong>couch-co-op</strong> game made to invoke the absolute <strong>chaos</strong> of playing <strong>split screen</strong> arcade games as a kid. This game will make you<i> <span class=\"bb_strike\">want to smash your friends head through the TV</span></i> have unforgettable moments with your friends.<br><u><strong> </strong></u><br><u><strong>5-10 minutes of pure fun,</strong></u>  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/fc4336fa4ea28259b29b8dc39df6954a.poster.avif?t=1750311983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/fc4336fa4ea28259b29b8dc39df6954a.webm?t=1750311983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/fc4336fa4ea28259b29b8dc39df6954a.mp4?t=1750311983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i><br> <br> <br><u><strong>Remote Play Supported! </strong></u><br> <br>If you and your &quot;Friend&quot; wants to play together, you can do so via Remote Play.  <br>Follow the instructions below on how to set it up. <br><i>Note: This is only required if you are playing with a friend on a remote PC, if you both are in the same PC skip this</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/59722551c05f564e22d245ce6ac0ca31.avif?t=1750311983\" width=800 height=450 /></span><u>Setup </u> <br>\u00a01. Open the Game <br>\u00a02. The Host <strong>will need to have one additional Input Device (Controller) connected</strong> apart from the keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Shift+Tab -&gt; Right Click on a Friend -&gt; Invite Remote Play.  <br>4. Once they have Joined, Shift + Tab again, find the remote play Icon on the bottom, and you should see your friends name on the Remote play list. <br>5. Click on the Keyboard and Mouse Icon next to the Friends name to Give access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Success! They should now be able to use their own Keyboard &amp;Mouse or a Controller to play with you!. <br> <br><strong><u>How to Play</u></strong> <br> <br>The objective is simple, outlast your friend in the arena. <br> <br> If you step on a tile, the tile will fall shortly after. So be careful where you tread,  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/8a6f2c2841a6af5ef53a586cc5007536.avif?t=1750311983\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span>If you want to speed up the winning process, shoot explosives at the other friend which will break all the tiles instantly upon impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/5779b7b2965217559b00554708d97e5f.avif?t=1750311983\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span><u>This game features ground breaking mechanics and new features such as.</u> <br> <br>- No micro-transactions: If we bother to make a skin, just take it. <br>- No battle-passes that unlock useless items on level up. <br>- No annoying ads asking you to review and rate our game. <i>(We already know its awesome, we don't need you to tell us that.) </i><br> <br> <br> <br>- Actually having a good time with your friends. <i>(I know it's a bit out there but we think it just might work.)</i> <br> <br>Play with either 2 Controllers, or Single Controller and a Keyboard &amp; Mouse. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is ground breaking</strong>-ly fun! The most popular game at our local gamescom is now on Steam! <strong>This Game is Ground breaking</strong> is a <strong>couch-co-op</strong> game made to invoke the absolute <strong>chaos</strong> of playing <strong>split screen</strong> arcade games as a kid. This game will make you<i> <span class=\"bb_strike\">want to smash your friends head through the TV</span></i> have unforgettable moments with your friends.<br><u><strong> </strong></u><br><u><strong>5-10 minutes of pure fun,</strong></u>  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/fc4336fa4ea28259b29b8dc39df6954a.poster.avif?t=1750311983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/fc4336fa4ea28259b29b8dc39df6954a.webm?t=1750311983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/fc4336fa4ea28259b29b8dc39df6954a.mp4?t=1750311983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i><br> <br> <br><u><strong>Remote Play Supported! </strong></u><br> <br>If you and your &quot;Friend&quot; wants to play together, you can do so via Remote Play.  <br>Follow the instructions below on how to set it up. <br><i>Note: This is only required if you are playing with a friend on a remote PC, if you both are in the same PC skip this</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/59722551c05f564e22d245ce6ac0ca31.avif?t=1750311983\" width=800 height=450 /></span><u>Setup </u> <br>\u00a01. Open the Game <br>\u00a02. The Host <strong>will need to have one additional Input Device (Controller) connected</strong> apart from the keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Shift+Tab -&gt; Right Click on a Friend -&gt; Invite Remote Play.  <br>4. Once they have Joined, Shift + Tab again, find the remote play Icon on the bottom, and you should see your friends name on the Remote play list. <br>5. Click on the Keyboard and Mouse Icon next to the Friends name to Give access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Success! They should now be able to use their own Keyboard &amp;Mouse or a Controller to play with you!. <br> <br><strong><u>How to Play</u></strong> <br> <br>The objective is simple, outlast your friend in the arena. <br> <br> If you step on a tile, the tile will fall shortly after. So be careful where you tread,  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/8a6f2c2841a6af5ef53a586cc5007536.avif?t=1750311983\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span>If you want to speed up the winning process, shoot explosives at the other friend which will break all the tiles instantly upon impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561850/extras/5779b7b2965217559b00554708d97e5f.avif?t=1750311983\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span><u>This game features ground breaking mechanics and new features such as.</u> <br> <br>- No micro-transactions: If we bother to make a skin, just take it. <br>- No battle-passes that unlock useless items on level up. <br>- No annoying ads asking you to review and rate our game. <i>(We already know its awesome, we don't need you to tell us that.) </i><br> <br> <br> <br>- Actually having a good time with your friends. <i>(I know it's a bit out there but we think it just might work.)</i> <br> <br>Play with either 2 Controllers, or Single Controller and a Keyboard &amp; Mouse. </p>",
